WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.179 --> 00:00:05.589
We are taking calls at six one seven eight
three zero 47 50.

00:00:05.589 --> 00:00:09.970
Let's go next to Ronald Reagan, who is on
the line today.

00:00:09.970 --> 00:00:11.700
Ronald, what's going on?

00:00:11.700 --> 00:00:13.770
Oh, hey, David.

00:00:13.770 --> 00:00:15.840
How's the gone?

00:00:15.840 --> 00:00:18.000
Good, how are you?

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:19.150
Good.

00:00:19.150 --> 00:00:27.490
I wanted to say I really appreciated your
tone, the tone of you.

00:00:27.490 --> 00:00:34.620
So I think that you are taking the threats
of what was staring down very seriously.

00:00:34.620 --> 00:00:35.920
And which threat is that?

00:00:35.920 --> 00:00:37.239
Shape them.

00:00:37.239 --> 00:00:45.140
Well, what's coming in November and what's
to come in another four years if we don't

00:00:45.140 --> 00:00:46.920
do the right thing?

00:00:46.920 --> 00:00:47.920
Got it.

00:00:47.920 --> 00:00:48.920
Yeah.

00:00:48.920 --> 00:00:54.761
I mean, I think there's a lot of navel gazing
on the left and sort of like, you know, like

00:00:54.761 --> 00:01:00.559
there's a time and a place I feel like for
another I'm some DNC lackey or anything like

00:01:00.559 --> 00:01:01.559
that.

00:01:01.559 --> 00:01:10.180
But it's just really frustrating, I think,
to see people treating this as sort of like

00:01:10.180 --> 00:01:12.740
situation normal and it's not.

00:01:12.740 --> 00:01:20.720
I do want to suggest I don't know if it's
possible to line up a week of shows or something

00:01:20.720 --> 00:01:26.540
like that where you break down sort of the
battleground states and their electoral systems

00:01:26.540 --> 00:01:31.540
and who's in charge and what those states
with the voting should look like.

00:01:31.540 --> 00:01:38.390
Because I do think on election night and I'm
through afterwards, like we're likely to see

00:01:38.390 --> 00:01:44.770
some irregularities and it would be good as
people are prepared for that.

00:01:44.770 --> 00:01:48.909
I think that that is good, you know, I think
to be totally transparent.

00:01:48.909 --> 00:01:54.159
I think a week of shows listing state voting
systems would be pretty bad.

00:01:54.159 --> 00:01:56.290
I don't I don't think my audience will really
shift that.

00:01:56.290 --> 00:01:58.060
Nearly two weeks would be even worse.

00:01:58.060 --> 00:01:59.240
That would be twice as bad.

00:01:59.240 --> 00:02:04.530
But what I will continue to do is to let people
know where it is that they can find out in

00:02:04.530 --> 00:02:05.619
their state.

00:02:05.619 --> 00:02:07.170
Where can you early vote?

00:02:07.170 --> 00:02:09.039
When can you start early voting?

00:02:09.039 --> 00:02:10.899
What's the process for voting absentee?

00:02:10.899 --> 00:02:12.680
Can you drop off your absentee ballot?

00:02:12.680 --> 00:02:14.890
That I will keep giving people the resources
to figure that out.

00:02:14.890 --> 00:02:17.790
But I'm not going to do two weeks of shows
on that, unfortunately.

00:02:17.790 --> 00:02:19.209
Well, all right.

00:02:19.209 --> 00:02:20.209
Yeah.

00:02:20.209 --> 00:02:22.069
We've come to a compromise.

00:02:22.069 --> 00:02:23.819
I'm glad that we've done that fair.

00:02:23.819 --> 00:02:24.819
Keep it.

00:02:24.819 --> 00:02:26.430
Keep up the good work.

00:02:26.430 --> 00:02:29.459
And one of my good friend who I mean, look,
you don't have to put this on your show.

00:02:29.459 --> 00:02:31.159
You don't want to.

00:02:31.159 --> 00:02:36.040
But who I met literally through the majority
report.

00:02:36.040 --> 00:02:38.310
He's now he's now a David Pakman member.

00:02:38.310 --> 00:02:40.629
And like a big fan of your show, he does love
me.

00:02:40.629 --> 00:02:42.469
So that's huge.

00:02:42.469 --> 00:02:49.969
So, you know, I don't want you to think it's
all antagonistic coming from the Reagan.

00:02:49.969 --> 00:02:50.969
I love it.

00:02:50.969 --> 00:02:51.969
I love it.

00:02:51.969 --> 00:02:52.969
All right, my friend, thank you for the call.

00:02:52.969 --> 00:02:53.969
Take care.

00:02:53.969 --> 00:02:54.969
All right.

00:02:54.969 --> 00:02:57.919
We'll see if there's Ronald Reagan, not Reagan,
like the President.

00:02:57.919 --> 00:03:01.139
Reagan like a ray, like a cathode ray gun.

00:03:01.139 --> 00:03:02.790
As if if you can imagine that.

